                <head>Annex 26</head>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#italic">Statement by the United States
                        Delegation on Annex 7 of the Treaty—Part I—United Kingdom Proposals on
                        Contracts</hi></p>
                <p>The United States opposed the U.K. proposals on contracts, primarily because it
                    regards paragraph 2 (<hi rendition="#italic">f</hi>) as unreasonable.</p>
            </div>
